WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:03.128
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.211 --> 00:05.004
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.088 --> 00:06.715
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.798 --> 00:08.383
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.466 --> 00:11.136
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.219 --> 00:13.555
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.638 --> 00:15.849
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.932 --> 00:17.642
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.726 --> 00:20.019
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.103 --> 00:21.813
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.896 --> 00:24.065
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.149 --> 00:26.192
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.276 --> 00:28.194
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:28.278 --> 00:29.654
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.738 --> 00:31.531
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.614 --> 00:33.700
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.783 --> 00:37.078
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants. ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤。 ♪

00:45.420 --> 00:46.421
Captioning provided by
MTV Networks
字幕提供者
MTV网络

01:11.070 --> 01:12.781
May I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

01:12.864 --> 01:14.574
Well...
出色地...

01:14.657 --> 01:16.451
it's almost quittin'
time, Squidward.
几乎要放弃了
时间到了，章鱼哥。

01:18.411 --> 01:19.621
Got any big plans
for after work?
有什么大计划吗
下班后？

01:22.290 --> 01:23.041
Nope.
没有。

01:29.631 --> 01:31.549
: Grr...
: 呃...

01:31.633 --> 01:33.468
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

01:33.551 --> 01:35.178
Pretty incredible
shift, huh?
相当不可思议
换班吧？

01:35.261 --> 01:37.263
If you say so.
如果你这么说的话。

01:37.347 --> 01:39.432
Any plans after work?
下班后有什么计划吗？

01:39.516 --> 01:41.100
No.
不。

01:41.184 --> 01:43.186
Yeah, me neither.
是的，我也一样。

01:43.269 --> 01:45.939
Just gonna be hangin'
at  "Casa de Sponge".
只是会挂着
在“海绵之家”。

01:46.022 --> 01:47.941
Feel free to drop by if
you're in the neighborhood.
如果有的话请随时过来
你就在附近。

01:52.862 --> 01:54.906
Hey Squidward, wait up.
嘿，章鱼哥，等一下。

01:54.989 --> 01:57.575
Squidward, I realize
that I didn't really extend
章鱼哥我明白了
我并没有真正扩展

01:57.659 --> 01:59.911
a proper invitation
back there.
适当的邀请
回到那里。

01:59.994 --> 02:02.163
So what do
ya say, Squidward?
那怎么办
你说，章鱼哥？

02:02.247 --> 02:04.666
How 'bout you come over to my
house for a visit tonight?
你到我这里来怎么样？
今晚要去看望房子吗？

02:06.626 --> 02:09.295
Squidward, Squidward?
章鱼哥，章鱼哥？

02:09.379 --> 02:13.091
Squidward, Squidward?
章鱼哥，章鱼哥？

02:13.174 --> 02:16.302
SpongeBob, thank you so much
海绵宝宝，非常感谢你

02:16.386 --> 02:18.930
for that lovely invitation
为了那个可爱的邀请

02:19.013 --> 02:21.516
but I must
respectfully tell you
但我必须
恭敬地告诉你

02:21.599 --> 02:23.935
I will never visit you.
我永远不会拜访你。

02:24.018 --> 02:25.520
Ever!
曾经！

02:27.313 --> 02:29.440
Take heart, Squidward.
振作起来，章鱼哥。

02:29.524 --> 02:31.776
It'll all be over soon.
一切很快就会结束。

02:31.860 --> 02:34.654
: Ohh...
: 哦...

02:34.737 --> 02:38.157
Please  come over
for a visit, Squidward.
请过来
来拜访，章鱼哥。

02:38.241 --> 02:39.951
It's been so long.
已经过去这么久了。

02:40.034 --> 02:43.788
I can't even remember
your last visit.
我什至不记得了
您上次来访。

02:43.872 --> 02:46.833
That's probably because
I've never visited you.
这可能是因为
我从来没有拜访过你。

02:46.916 --> 02:50.336
: Please,
please, please...
: 拜托，
拜托，拜托……

02:50.420 --> 02:53.006
Please!
请！

02:53.089 --> 02:54.966
Please...
请...

02:57.552 --> 02:58.887
Please?
请？

02:58.970 --> 03:00.221
Please?
请？

03:00.305 --> 03:02.056
Please, please-please...
拜托，拜托，拜托……

03:02.140 --> 03:03.433
Please, please-please.
拜托，拜托，拜托。

03:03.516 --> 03:05.101
: Please...
： 请...

03:05.184 --> 03:06.978
Please... Please.
拜托...拜托。

03:13.735 --> 03:15.945
OK, Squidward,
maybe some other time.
好的，章鱼哥，
也许其他时间。

03:16.029 --> 03:17.947
French man: 24 hours later.
法国人：24小时后。

03:21.284 --> 03:22.535
Hey-o Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

03:22.619 --> 03:24.329
You got any...
你有什么...

03:24.412 --> 03:26.331
Before you ask me
that question
在你问我之前
那个问题

03:26.414 --> 03:28.625
ask yourself this:
问问自己：

03:28.708 --> 03:33.880
Why would I leave
the comfort of  my  home
我为什么要离开
我家的舒适

03:36.591 --> 03:38.885
what if I got a couple
for  your  dirty of throw pillows?
如果我有一对怎么办
为你肮脏的抱枕？

03:42.972 --> 03:46.225
Patrick, has Squidward
ever visited you at home?
帕特里克有章鱼哥
曾经拜访过你家吗？

03:46.309 --> 03:48.019
Only once.
只有一次。

03:48.102 --> 03:50.438
To take back some
stuff I borrowed.
去拿回一些
我借的东西。

03:50.521 --> 03:52.607
He said he wouldn't leave
the comfort of his own home
他说他不会离开
自己家的舒适感

03:52.690 --> 03:55.068
for my dirty little hovel.
为了我肮脏的小茅屋。

03:55.151 --> 03:58.321
Borrow something,
then he'll have to come
over to get it back.
借东西，
那么他就必须来
过去把它拿回来。

03:58.404 --> 04:00.323
Ah!
啊!

04:00.406 --> 04:03.284
Well... Hey, thanks for letting
me play puzzle with you.
嗯...嘿，谢谢你让
我和你一起玩拼图。

04:03.368 --> 04:04.494
See ya later.
稍后见。

04:04.577 --> 04:05.995
That's it.
就是这样。

04:06.079 --> 04:07.705
Squidward: A stick of butter
章鱼哥：一块黄油

04:07.789 --> 04:10.750
and just a touch of pepper.
和一点胡椒粉。

04:10.833 --> 04:12.043
Gah!
嘎！

04:17.465 --> 04:19.217
Not on the rug.
不在地毯上。

04:19.300 --> 04:21.386
: Oh.
： 哦。

04:21.469 --> 04:23.638
SpongeBob, will
you keep it down?
海绵宝宝，会
你把它记下来吗？

04:23.721 --> 04:25.431
I am trying to cook.
我正在尝试做饭。

04:25.515 --> 04:27.183
Oh hey, Squidward.
哦嘿，章鱼哥。

04:27.266 --> 04:29.477
Just doing a little
home improvement.
只做一点点
家居装修。

04:29.560 --> 04:32.438
Well, you made me
spill pepper all over
my imported rug.
好吧，是你让我
把胡椒洒得到处都是
我的进口地毯。

04:32.522 --> 04:34.190
:
OK, Squidward.
：
好的，章鱼哥。

04:35.858 --> 04:37.694
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

04:37.777 --> 04:40.279
Need the right tool for the job.
需要适合这项工作的工具。

04:40.363 --> 04:41.739
Huh?
啊？

04:41.823 --> 04:43.783
SpongeBob: "Dear Squidward...
海绵宝宝：“亲爱的章鱼哥……

04:43.866 --> 04:45.785
Thanks for lending me
your vacuum cleaner.
谢谢你借给我
你的吸尘器。

04:45.868 --> 04:48.079
Sincerely,
SpongeBob SquarePants."
真诚的，
海绵宝宝。”

04:48.162 --> 04:49.414
Oh, P.S.
哦，附注

04:49.497 --> 04:51.207
: Bah...
: 呸...

04:51.290 --> 04:53.001
Bah...
呸...

04:53.084 --> 04:54.544
Bah...
呸...

04:57.338 --> 04:59.215
SquarePants residence.
方裤住宅。

04:59.298 --> 05:01.467
Why do you have
my vacuum cleaner?
为什么你有
我的吸尘器？

05:01.551 --> 05:03.428
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

05:03.511 --> 05:05.638
It's been quite a while
since I last got a call
已经有一段时间了
自从我上次接到电话以来

05:05.722 --> 05:07.724
from my favorite
next door neighbor.
从我最喜欢的
隔壁邻居。

05:07.807 --> 05:10.226
That's because
I've  never  called you.
那是因为
我从来没有给你打过电话。

05:10.310 --> 05:12.812
Now, why have you stolen
my vacuum cleaner?
现在，你为什么要偷东西
我的吸尘器？

05:12.895 --> 05:15.273
I didn't steal it, silly,
I borrowed it.
我又没偷，傻瓜
我借的。

05:15.356 --> 05:18.985
Are you done cleaning up that
dingy hole you call home?
你清理完了吗
你称之为家的肮脏洞？

05:19.068 --> 05:22.363
You won't even recognize
the place, Squidward  .
你甚至不会认出
这个地方，章鱼哥。

05:22.447 --> 05:23.698
Yeah, probably not.
是的，可能不会。

05:30.329 --> 05:32.331
I'll be over to get
my vacuum in 20 minutes.
我会过去得到
20分钟后我的吸尘器就完成了

05:34.208 --> 05:37.378
Oh, Squidward is finally
coming for a visit.
哦，章鱼哥终于来了
前来参观。

05:37.462 --> 05:39.672
:
Sassa frassin
mala pookin tarny rasser...
：
檫木
马拉普金塔尼雷瑟...

05:43.051 --> 05:45.678
Squidward,
I've been expecting you.
章鱼哥，
我一直在等你。

05:45.762 --> 05:48.639
Welcome to my humble abode.
欢迎来到我简陋的住所。

05:48.723 --> 05:50.975
I hope that you
will find comfort
我希望你
会找到安慰

05:51.059 --> 05:53.269
and please don't hesitate
to ask me if there's
anything that I can...
请不要犹豫
问我是否有
任何我能做的...

05:53.352 --> 05:55.271
Yeah, uh-huh, I just want
my vacuum back...
是啊，嗯，我只是想要
我的真空吸尘器回来了...

05:55.354 --> 05:59.275
You've made an exact
replica of my living room.
你已经做了一个精确的
我客厅的复制品。

05:59.358 --> 06:02.028
Well, you said
you wouldn't leave
the comfort of your home.
嗯，你说
你不会离开
您家的舒适度。

06:02.111 --> 06:04.697
So I brought
the comfort here.
所以我带了
这里的舒适度。

06:04.781 --> 06:07.617
Isn't it great  ?
不是很好吗？

06:07.700 --> 06:09.410
No, it isn't.
不，不是。

06:09.494 --> 06:12.371
You can't just steal
my decorating style and...
你不能只是偷窃
我的装修风格和...

06:14.874 --> 06:17.001
Never mind,
just give me my vacuum.
没关系，
把我的真空吸尘器给我吧。

06:17.085 --> 06:18.795
Would you care for a cool
and refreshing iced tea?
你想要一个酷吗
和清爽的冰茶？

06:18.878 --> 06:20.421
No.
不。

06:20.505 --> 06:21.881
No.
不。

06:21.964 --> 06:23.758
No.
不。

06:23.841 --> 06:25.885
I don't even know
what that is.
我什至不知道
那是什么。

06:25.968 --> 06:27.678
Please just give me my vacuum
so I can get back home.
请给我我的真空吸尘器
这样我就可以回家了。

06:27.762 --> 06:28.930
I have a casserole
in the oven.
我有一个砂锅
在烤箱里。

06:29.013 --> 06:31.057
Yes, of course.
是的当然。

06:31.140 --> 06:32.725
Please, have a seat while
I go grab your vacuum.
请坐
我去拿你的真空吸尘器。

06:32.809 --> 06:34.227
Please make yourself at home.
请别客气。

06:36.145 --> 06:38.731
Enjoying your visit
so far, Squidward?
享受您的访问
到目前为止，章鱼哥？

06:38.815 --> 06:40.691
This is not a visit.
这不是一次访问。

06:40.775 --> 06:42.735
You are going
to get my vacuum.
你要去
得到我的真空吸尘器。

06:42.819 --> 06:44.695
And stop fluffing
this pillow.
并停止起毛
这个枕头。

06:44.779 --> 06:46.656
OK, Squidward.
好的，章鱼哥。

06:46.739 --> 06:48.032
Just yell if you
need anything.
只要大喊一声，如果你
需要任何东西。

06:48.116 --> 06:51.244
Imbecile...
蠢货...

06:51.327 --> 06:53.162
How did he do it?
他是怎么做到的？

06:53.246 --> 06:56.082
He got my coffee table,
my vase, snack bowl...
他拿走了我的咖啡桌，
我的花瓶、零食碗……

06:56.165 --> 06:59.794
Coasters, and my "Art of the
Clarinet" coffee table book.
杯垫和我的“艺术”
单簧管”咖啡桌书。

06:59.877 --> 07:04.090
And this pillow looks just like
the one mommy made for me.
这个枕头看起来就像
妈妈为我做的那个。

07:04.173 --> 07:07.468
He even copied
her stitch signature.
他甚至抄袭
她的针迹签名。

07:07.552 --> 07:10.304
"For Squiddy with love, Mama."
“妈妈，用爱献给鱿鱼。”

07:10.388 --> 07:11.764
: Ahh!
：啊！

07:11.848 --> 07:13.808
You yelled?
你喊了？

07:13.891 --> 07:15.560
Never mind, I'll find
the vacuum myself.
没关系，我会找到的
我自己真空。

07:15.643 --> 07:18.104
OK, make yourself at home.
好吧，别客气了。

07:18.187 --> 07:20.273
Squidward sure seems to
be enjoying his visit.
章鱼哥确实似乎
很享受他的来访。

07:20.356 --> 07:22.650
My hallway.
我的走廊。

07:22.733 --> 07:25.611
Dear Neptune.
亲爱的海王星。

07:25.695 --> 07:29.115
He even got the chip in
the paint from when I moved in.
他甚至还拿到了芯片
我搬进来时的油漆。

07:29.198 --> 07:32.702
OK, Squiddy,
don't get creeped out.
好吧，鱿鱼，
别被吓到了。

07:32.785 --> 07:35.121
Just get the vacuum and go home.
只需拿起真空吸尘器然后回家即可。

07:37.039 --> 07:39.333
All right, isn't  this  neat?
好吧，这不是很整洁吗？

07:39.417 --> 07:40.209
My bathroom.
我的浴室。

07:45.006 --> 07:46.757
I have to give him
credit, though.
我必须给他
不过，信用。

07:46.841 --> 07:50.136
Every detail is correct.
每个细节都是正确的。

07:50.219 --> 07:53.764
How does he know the exact
contents of my medicine cabinet?
他怎么知道准确的
我的药柜里有什么？

07:53.848 --> 07:55.016
My rash cream?
我的痱子膏呢？

07:55.099 --> 07:56.976
That little sneak!
那个小鬼鬼祟祟的！

07:57.059 --> 07:58.728
Did someone
say rash cream?
有人吗
说皮疹膏？

07:58.811 --> 08:00.897
SpongeBob,
you idiot!
海绵宝宝，
你这个白痴！

08:00.980 --> 08:01.939
Squidward, rash cream.
鱿鱼，皮疹膏。

08:04.525 --> 08:06.444
Oops.
哎呀。

08:08.487 --> 08:09.822
oh, no.
哦，不。

08:09.906 --> 08:11.157
Aww...
哇...

08:11.240 --> 08:12.700
Help!
帮助！

08:14.827 --> 08:16.537
I don't think I have
a cream for that.
我不认为我有
一个奶油。

08:21.834 --> 08:25.046
Oh, what a horrible nightmare.
哦，多么可怕的噩梦啊。

08:25.129 --> 08:28.841
So are you enjoying your
stay at  "Chez Sponge?"
那么你享受你的
住在“海绵之家”？

08:32.887 --> 08:34.597
Ahh...
啊...

08:34.680 --> 08:37.183
Will you excuse me for a moment?
请原谅我一下好吗？

08:37.266 --> 08:39.352
I need to use
the bathroom again.
我需要使用
又是浴室。

08:40.895 --> 08:42.855
Hurry back,
Squidward.
快点回来，
章鱼哥。

08:42.939 --> 08:45.441
I gotta find that vacuum
and get out of here.
我得找到那个真空
然后离开这里。

08:48.778 --> 08:49.445
Ah!
啊!

08:51.280 --> 08:54.325
He copied all 492
of my self-portraits.
他复制了全部 492 个
我的自画像。

08:57.745 --> 09:00.665
And they're better than mine.
而且他们比我的更好。

09:04.961 --> 09:07.922
He even got the rug right.
他甚至还把地毯铺好了。

09:08.005 --> 09:09.715
Get a hold of yourself,
Squiddy, old bean.
把握好自己，
鱿鱼，老豆子。

09:09.799 --> 09:11.550
This doesn't mean anything.
这没有任何意义。

09:11.634 --> 09:14.595
This, this... all of
this is just, just...
这，这……全部
这只是，只是……

09:14.679 --> 09:17.056
mimicry.
模仿。

09:17.139 --> 09:18.933
He doesn't possess your style
他没有你的风格

09:19.016 --> 09:20.893
or your decorating acumen
或者你的装饰天赋

09:20.977 --> 09:23.938
or your love of
the finer things.
或你的爱
更精细的事情。

09:24.021 --> 09:26.232
In fact, the only thing
he has is...
其实唯一的事情就是
他有的是...

09:26.315 --> 09:28.067
is, is...
是、是...

09:28.150 --> 09:30.987
my vacuum cleaner.
我的吸尘器。

09:31.070 --> 09:32.446
And I'll remedy that
我会解决这个问题

09:32.530 --> 09:35.283
...post-haste.
...急如星火。

09:35.366 --> 09:37.743
Ah-ha.
啊哈。

09:37.827 --> 09:41.289
He put you in here along
with all his bad taste.
他把你一起放在这里
和他所有的坏品味。

09:41.372 --> 09:44.041
You're coming home  ...
你要回家了...

09:44.125 --> 09:46.252
home... with me.
家……和我在一起。

09:46.335 --> 09:47.962
: With me.
： 与我一起。

09:55.803 --> 09:57.388
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

10:10.526 --> 10:12.069
Is it really you?
真的是你吗？

10:14.030 --> 10:15.615
It  is  you.
是你。

10:15.698 --> 10:17.616
Mwah, mwah, mwah, mwah, mwah.
哇，哇，哇，哇，哇。

10:17.700 --> 10:19.493
Come on, baby.
来吧，宝贝。

10:19.577 --> 10:21.078
You and I will walk
out of this horror show
你和我将行走
从这部恐怖剧中

10:21.162 --> 10:22.621
the way we walked into it:
我们走进它的方式：

10:22.705 --> 10:25.166
with dignity and aplomb.
带着尊严和沉着。

10:31.380 --> 10:32.965
My house.
我的房子。

10:33.049 --> 10:35.134
You just missed
the fire.
你刚刚错过了
火。

10:35.217 --> 10:37.303
What happened
to my house?
发生了什么
到我家吗？

10:37.386 --> 10:40.806
Oh, some knucklehead left
a casserole in the oven.
哦，还剩下一些傻瓜
烤箱里的砂锅。

10:40.890 --> 10:41.974
Sponge...
海绵...

10:42.058 --> 10:45.144
...Bob!
...鲍勃！

10:45.227 --> 10:47.271
Aw, don't worry, Squidward.
哦，别担心，章鱼哥。

10:47.355 --> 10:49.315
You're more than welcome
to stay at my house
非常欢迎您
住在我家

10:49.398 --> 10:51.067
until you get your house fixed.
直到你把房子修好。

10:57.406 --> 11:01.827
Why yes, I'd love another
spot of tea, Mr. Vacuum Cleaner.
为什么是的，我会喜欢另一个
点茶，吸尘器先生。

11:01.911 --> 11:04.038
Care for some casserole?
想要一些砂锅吗？

11:08.751 --> 11:11.587
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

11:11.670 --> 11:13.506
You OK?
你还好吗？

11:13.589 --> 11:14.840
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

11:14.924 --> 11:18.552
SpongeBob: Squidward!
海绵宝宝：章鱼哥！

11:20.888 --> 11:22.181
Ahh...
啊...

11:22.264 --> 11:24.725
Replica sweet replica.
复制品甜蜜的复制品。

11:28.813 --> 11:31.941
It sure was great
having Squidward over
for a visit, ay, Gary?
确实很棒
章鱼哥过来
来拜访，嗯，加里？

11:33.859 --> 11:35.111
Meow.
喵。

11:46.414 --> 11:49.458
French man:  Ah, another quiet
day in Bikini Bottom.
法国男人：啊，又安静了
比基尼泳裤的一天。

11:49.542 --> 11:52.711
But it wasn't always this way.
但情况并非总是如此。

11:52.795 --> 11:55.047
Once it was horrible.
有一次真是太可怕了。

12:05.015 --> 12:06.767
The unimaginable happened.
难以想象的事情发生了。

12:06.851 --> 12:10.813
One day, SpongeBob SquarePants
有一天，海绵宝宝

12:10.896 --> 12:13.357
changed his pants.
换了裤子。

12:24.285 --> 12:26.454
I remember as if
it were yesterday.
我记得好像
那是昨天的事了。

12:26.537 --> 12:29.623
But in fact,
it happened  three  days ago.
但事实上，
这件事发生在三天前。

12:40.926 --> 12:42.678
It's laundry
day, Gary.
这是洗衣服
天，加里。

12:44.555 --> 12:45.514
Oops.
哎呀。

12:47.057 --> 12:47.766
Meow.
喵。

12:49.894 --> 12:52.104
Now to finish the day's chores.
现在要完成一天的家务了。

13:01.530 --> 13:03.741
Hello?
你好？

13:03.824 --> 13:07.119
Hello, may I speak
with SpongeBob?
你好，我可以说话吗
和海绵宝宝？

13:07.203 --> 13:10.164
Uh, uh...
呃，呃……

13:10.247 --> 13:13.959
: Square...
： 正方形...

13:14.043 --> 13:16.378
Pants?
裤子？

13:16.462 --> 13:18.380
Mm, speaking.
嗯，说话了。

13:18.464 --> 13:21.842
Hey, hey, you wanna hear
how long I could do this for?
嘿嘿嘿你想听吗
我可以这样做多久？

13:21.926 --> 13:24.762
Blah-loo-blah-loo-blah-loo...
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦……

13:24.845 --> 13:26.931
Blah-loo-bla-loo-bla-loo...
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦……

13:27.014 --> 13:28.766
Actually, Patrick, I'm kind
of busy, can it wait?
事实上，帕特里克，我很友善
很忙，可以等吗？

13:28.849 --> 13:30.184
Blah-loo-blah-loo-blah-loo...
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦……

13:30.267 --> 13:31.519
No.
不。

13:31.602 --> 13:33.812
Blah-loo-blah-loo...
巴拉-卢-巴拉-卢...

13:36.857 --> 13:38.484
Much later.
很久以后。

13:38.567 --> 13:41.779
Blah-loo-blah-loo-blah-loo...
啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦……

13:41.862 --> 13:45.491
Softly: Gary, go check on
轻声：Gary，去看看吧

13:45.574 --> 13:47.868
Oh, meow.
哦，喵。

13:47.952 --> 13:49.912
...blah-loo-blah-loo-blah-loo...
...巴拉-卢-巴拉-卢-巴拉-卢...

14:04.885 --> 14:06.679
Much  much  later...
很久很久以后...

14:15.354 --> 14:18.524
Uh, pretty long time, huh?
呃，很长一段时间吧？

14:18.607 --> 14:21.151
Yeah, Patrick.
是的，帕特里克。

14:21.235 --> 14:22.528
Gary?
加里？

14:24.738 --> 14:26.782
They shrunk!
他们缩小了！

14:31.829 --> 14:34.123
I'm gonna need to get new pants.
我需要买条新裤子。

14:36.584 --> 14:39.712
Sales Clerk: I'm sorry,
Mr. SpongeBob,
but we're not expecting
售货员： 对不起，
海绵宝宝先生，
但我们并不期待

14:39.795 --> 14:42.089
another shipment
of SquarePants for months.
另一批货物
SquarePants 长达数月之久。

14:42.172 --> 14:43.966
Ohh...
哦...

14:47.761 --> 14:50.556
No, nope.
不，不。

14:50.639 --> 14:52.308
Ooh, not these.
哦，不是这些。

14:52.391 --> 14:53.142
Unh-unh.
呃呃。

14:57.605 --> 14:58.814
Whoa.
哇哦。

15:00.566 --> 15:03.319
These pants hug my body
这条裤子拥抱我的身体

15:03.402 --> 15:04.987
better than my own mother.
比我自己的母亲更好。

15:13.120 --> 15:14.413
Hey, Patrick...
嘿，帕特里克...

15:14.496 --> 15:17.249
Notice anything different?
注意到什么不同了吗？

15:17.333 --> 15:19.460
Pose, pose, pose...
姿势，姿势，姿势……

15:19.543 --> 15:21.420
...pose?
...姿势？

15:21.503 --> 15:24.089
: Bah...
it's me, SpongeBob.
: 呸...
是我，海绵宝宝。

15:24.173 --> 15:26.008
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

15:27.509 --> 15:29.637
No you're not.
不，你不是。

15:29.720 --> 15:33.015
SpongeBob has
square  pants.
海绵宝宝有
方裤。

15:33.098 --> 15:35.726
Now leave me alone,
you mysterious stranger.
现在让我一个人呆着吧
你这个神秘的陌生人。

15:37.853 --> 15:39.647
Patrick's so full
of tarter sauce.
帕特里克太饱了
塔塔酱。

15:39.730 --> 15:41.106
I'm still me.
我还是我。

15:41.190 --> 15:43.442
It's just a pair of pants.
这只是一条裤子。

15:43.525 --> 15:45.611
It's not like my friends
won't recognize me.
这不像我的朋友们
不会认出我的。

15:45.694 --> 15:47.613
Sandy: Well,
howdy, stranger.
桑迪：嗯，
你好，陌生人。

15:47.696 --> 15:50.491
I don't recognize you in
those new-fangled dungarees.
我认不出你了
那些新奇的工装裤

15:52.576 --> 15:54.953
You must be
SpongeBob Fancy Pants.
你一定是
海绵宝宝花式裤子。

15:55.037 --> 15:56.914
Clothes really
do make the man.
衣服确实
做男人。

15:56.997 --> 15:59.375
Sandy didn't
recognize me, either.
桑迪没有
也认得我。

15:59.458 --> 16:01.752
These pants are more powerful
than I thought.
这条裤子更有力量
比我想象的要多。

16:01.835 --> 16:03.962
'Course it was just sandy.
当然，那只是沙子。

16:04.046 --> 16:06.507
And Neptune knows what goes on
inside a squirrel's head.
海王星知道发生了什么
在松鼠的脑袋里。

16:08.717 --> 16:12.763
Eww... But I know my best buddy
Squidward will recognize me.
呃……但我认识我最好的朋友
章鱼哥会认出我的。

16:12.846 --> 16:15.349
We have been through
so much together.
我们已经经历过
在一起这么多。

16:15.432 --> 16:17.685
♪ La-la-la-la, la-la,
la-la, la-la, la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦，啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦♪

16:17.768 --> 16:19.645
Oh, no.
哦，不。

16:19.728 --> 16:22.398
It's that little
yellow freak.
就这么小
黄色怪物。

16:22.481 --> 16:24.274
:
Hi, Squidward.
：
嗨，章鱼哥。

16:24.358 --> 16:27.403
Just ignore him,
maybe he'll go away.
直接无视他就好了
也许他会走开。

16:27.486 --> 16:29.363
:
Oh, Squidward.
：
哦，章鱼哥。

16:29.446 --> 16:31.490
♪ Guess who? ♪
♪ 猜猜是谁？ ♪

16:31.573 --> 16:33.826
Do I know you?
我知道你？

16:33.909 --> 16:37.079
Oh, sure you do,
it's me.
哦，当然你知道，
是我。

16:37.162 --> 16:40.374
SpongeBob... SquarePants?
海绵宝宝...方裤？

16:40.457 --> 16:43.252
Never seen you
before in my life.
从未见过你
以前在我的生活中。

16:43.335 --> 16:44.253
Ooh.
哦。

16:46.505 --> 16:48.841
Well, maybe these pictures of us
together will jog your memory.
好吧，也许我们的这些照片
在一起会唤起你的记忆。

16:48.924 --> 16:50.926
Me and you at my birthday party.
我和你在我的生日聚会上。

16:51.009 --> 16:53.011
You and me at work.
你和我在工作。

16:53.095 --> 16:55.264
That little slumber party
we had last week.
那个小小的睡衣派对
我们上周有过。

16:55.347 --> 16:56.515
I forgot when this was taken.
我忘记了这是啥时候拍的。

16:59.643 --> 17:01.353
Is that supposed
to be you?
是这样认为的吗
成为你？

17:04.440 --> 17:06.400
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

17:06.483 --> 17:08.527
He actually left.
他确实离开了。

17:10.529 --> 17:12.030
Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

17:12.114 --> 17:13.866
It's like we'd never met.
就好像我们从未见过一样。

17:13.949 --> 17:16.535
Maybe Patrick is right.
也许帕特里克是对的。

17:16.618 --> 17:19.329
Oh, no, it's locked.
哦，不，它被锁了。

17:19.413 --> 17:21.623
Gary, hey Gary.
加里，嘿加里。

17:21.707 --> 17:23.375
Can you open the door?
你能开门吗？

17:23.459 --> 17:25.210
I left my keys
in my other pants.
我留下了钥匙
在我的另一条裤子里。

17:25.294 --> 17:26.545
Hello?
你好？

17:26.628 --> 17:28.047
Can I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

17:28.130 --> 17:30.132
Patrick, it's me, SpongeBob.
帕特里克，是我，海绵宝宝。

17:30.215 --> 17:33.385
Oh, right, you're that
Round Pants fellow.
噢，对了，你就是那个
圆裤的家伙。

17:33.469 --> 17:35.012
Patrick, what are you
doing in my house?
帕特里克，你是什么？
在我家做什么？

17:35.095 --> 17:37.055
Your house?
你家？

17:37.139 --> 17:40.809
This house belongs
to SpongeBob SquarePants.
这房子属于
海绵宝宝。

17:40.893 --> 17:42.519
At least it did
before he left us.
至少它做到了
在他离开我们之前。

17:45.105 --> 17:49.234
I wish I could see him
one last time.
我希望我能见到他
最后一次。

17:49.318 --> 17:50.444
Oh, barnacles.
哦，藤壶。

17:52.488 --> 17:56.283
I guess I'm not SpongeBob
SquarePants anymore.
我想我不是海绵宝宝
不再是四角裤了。

17:56.366 --> 17:58.494
I'll have to start
all over again.
我必须开始
一切重新来过。

17:58.577 --> 18:01.163
...Hello, sir, I'd like
an application, please.
...您好，先生，我想要
请提交一份申请。

18:03.290 --> 18:06.168
My name is SpongeBob
square... Ahh.
我的名字是海绵宝宝
方形...啊。

18:10.464 --> 18:12.132
Oh, whoo, hm.
哦，呼，嗯。

18:12.216 --> 18:14.259
Sorry, I'm a little
对不起，我有点

18:14.343 --> 18:17.054
I'm a little...
Sorry, I'm a little nervous.
我有点...
抱歉，我有点紧张。

18:17.137 --> 18:20.933
My name is SpongeBob
Round...  Pants.
我的名字是海绵宝宝
圆形...裤子。

18:21.016 --> 18:23.602
And I would like
to seek employment from
this eating establishment.
我想要
寻求就业
这家餐饮场所。

18:29.691 --> 18:32.569
Oh, dear, are you OK,
Mr. Cashier... Ooh!
噢，亲爱的，你还好吗，
收银员先生...哦！

18:32.653 --> 18:34.655
Here are the applications.
以下是应用程序。

18:34.738 --> 18:37.074
Let's see here.
让我们看看这里。

18:37.157 --> 18:40.494
Name: SpongeBob RoundPants.
名称：海绵宝宝圆裤。

18:40.577 --> 18:42.454
Well, this is going well.
嗯，一切进展顺利。

18:42.538 --> 18:45.415
Hey, Mr. Cashier,
looks like we're gonna be
嘿，收银员先生，
看起来我们会

18:45.499 --> 18:47.751
co-workers!
同事们！

18:49.962 --> 18:53.549
Question two: "Have you ever
been convicted of a felony?"
问题二：“你有没有
被判重罪了吗？”

18:53.632 --> 18:55.300
Hm, what's a felony?
嗯，什么是重罪？

18:55.384 --> 18:57.302
Being too darn happy
all the time.
太幸福了
一直。

18:57.386 --> 19:00.472
Oh, yeah, lots and
lots of felonies.
哦，是的，很多
很多重罪。

19:00.556 --> 19:01.932
Heh, moron.
呵呵，白痴。

19:04.059 --> 19:06.103
What's going on here?
这是怎么回事？

19:06.186 --> 19:07.604
I'm filling out
an application.
我正在填写
一个应用程序。

19:07.688 --> 19:09.064
Get to work.
开始工作吧。

19:09.147 --> 19:11.483
I got the job?
我得到了这份工作吗？

19:11.567 --> 19:14.153
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

19:14.236 --> 19:15.821
My first day
on the job.
我的第一天
在工作中。

19:15.904 --> 19:17.739
I am so excited.
我很兴奋。

19:17.823 --> 19:19.658
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

19:19.741 --> 19:21.368
Whatever.
任何。

19:21.451 --> 19:23.412
You've worked here a long time.
你在这里工作了很长时间了。

19:23.495 --> 19:24.913
Why don't you show
this rookie the ropes.
你为什么不显示
这个菜鸟绳索。

19:24.997 --> 19:26.832
Oh, I'd love to.
哦，我很愿意。

19:26.915 --> 19:29.001
Yay!
耶！

19:29.084 --> 19:30.919
What, no, don't...
什么，不，不要...

19:33.088 --> 19:34.673
So what do I do first?
那么我首先要做什么？

19:34.756 --> 19:36.466
: Fine.
： 美好的。

19:36.550 --> 19:39.094
Take a Krabby Patty
and put it on the grill.
吃一个蟹肉饼
然后把它放在烤架上。

19:39.177 --> 19:41.013
Shouldn't you watch it?
难道你不应该看吗？

19:41.096 --> 19:43.682
Why, I don't think
it's going anywhere.
为什么，我不认为
它会去任何地方。

19:43.765 --> 19:46.643
Ooh, very Zen.
哦，很有禅意。

19:51.064 --> 19:53.150
What next, oh, oracle
of Krabby wisdom?
接下来呢，哦，神谕
蟹蟹的智慧？

19:53.233 --> 19:54.985
I'm going to the bathroom.
我要去趟洗手间。

19:56.904 --> 19:57.654
Hm, I'll go too.
嗯，我也去。

20:02.993 --> 20:05.037
How's it going in there, boss?
老板，里面怎么样？

20:07.080 --> 20:08.540
Um... Fine.
嗯……好吧。

20:08.624 --> 20:10.626
"Going fine."
“一切顺利。”

20:17.382 --> 20:19.009
Oh,
Mr. Squidward?
哦，
章鱼哥先生？

20:19.092 --> 20:20.218
What's you reading?
你在读什么？

20:22.262 --> 20:23.972
"Bathroom break", check.
“上厕所休息”，检查一下。

20:26.558 --> 20:29.061
Here's the slop
you ordered... Enjoy.
这是斜坡
您订购了...享受吧。

20:29.144 --> 20:31.063
If you can choke it down.
如果你能把它压下去的话。

20:31.146 --> 20:33.899
: Ha, ha-ha-ha.
: 哈哈哈哈。

20:33.982 --> 20:37.736
"Be rude to customer
and insult food.
“对顾客无礼
并侮辱食物。

20:37.819 --> 20:38.654
Nasally laugh."
笑得鼻青脸肿。”

20:53.877 --> 20:55.629
Could I get
a Krabby Patty combo?
我可以得到
蟹肉饼组合？

20:55.712 --> 20:57.422
No.
不。

20:57.506 --> 20:59.257
How 'bout a double
Krabby Patty?
双人怎么样
克拉比·帕蒂？

20:59.341 --> 21:01.468
Can I get a triple
patty with cheese?
我可以得到三份吗
奶酪馅饼？

21:01.551 --> 21:03.261
Oh, I think you've had
way  too many of those.
哦，我想你已经有过
太多了。

21:12.312 --> 21:14.940
Taught him
everything
he knows.
教他的
一切
他知道。

21:18.151 --> 21:20.696
: Oh, ooh...
: 噢噢...

21:40.340 --> 21:41.967
Customer: Come on.
顾客：来吧。

21:42.050 --> 21:43.969
Customer:
Excuse me?
客户：
对不起？

21:44.052 --> 21:45.220
What are
you two doing?
什么是
你们两个在做什么？

21:45.303 --> 21:47.264
Get to work!
开始工作吧！

21:47.347 --> 21:49.558
I'm used to Squidward
sleeping on the job
我已经习惯了章鱼哥
工作时睡觉

21:49.641 --> 21:52.769
but I expect more
from you Mr. SquarePants.
但我期待更多
来自你方裤先生。

21:52.853 --> 21:56.231
I am not SpongeBob SquarePants,
Mr. Krabs.
我不是海绵宝宝
蟹老板。

21:56.314 --> 21:58.775
What in the name of Davy Jones
are you talking about?
以戴维·琼斯的名义
你在说什么？

21:58.859 --> 22:02.195
I mean, do these pants
look square to you?
我是说，这条裤子
你觉得方形吗？

22:02.279 --> 22:03.613
They're round.
它们是圆的。

22:03.697 --> 22:05.699
Yeah, so?
是啊，所以？

22:05.782 --> 22:09.911
I can't be SpongeBob SquarePants
with  round  pants.
我不能成为海绵宝宝
